You (in contrast to the model that the prompt is for) can use web search and web fetch{% if domain_pages %}. Use web_fetch to read the pages listed below before you attach one; beyond those, most prompts should not need the tools{% else %}, but most prompts should not need them{% endif %}: write from what you already know, and search or fetch only if the prompt genuinely requires {% if domain_pages %}other {% else %}real {% endif %}source material (e.g., quoting an actual passage) or would otherwise rest on a guessed-at specific.

